{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/313667-the-dream-kingdoms-of-the-world","id":313667,"title":"The Dream Kingdoms of the World","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-16T07:06:34-08:00","id":313667,"title":"The Dream Kingdoms of the World","content":"I'm looking for some Changeling the Dreaming inspiration, and was wondering if anyone has ever used any of the following:<br /> <br /> -The Kingdom of Neustria (France)<br /> -Navarre (Portal)<br /> -Aragon (Spain)<br /> -Leone (Spain)<br /> -Castille (Spain)<br /> -The Kingdom of Flowers (Netherlands)<br /> -The Kingdom of Golden Threads (Belgium and Luxembourg)<br /> -Duchy of Tulips (Amsterdam)<br /> -The Galacian Confederation (Germany, Switzerland, Italy, Greece, -Finland, Eastern Europe and several nations of the former Soviet Union)<br /> -The Isle of Snowflakes (Iceland)<br /> -The Kingdom of Dalarna (Sweden and Norway)<br /> -The Kingdom of Jutland (Denmark)<br /> -The Caliphate of Cedars (The Levant)<br /> -The Sultanate of Hejaz(The Arabian Peninsula)<br /> -The Empire of the Caucasus (Turkey and the Caspian Sea Basin)<br /> Aglahbib (North Africa)<br /> -Nubia (Sudan)<br /> -Isles of the Wandering Dream (Australia and New Zealand)<br /> <br /> The Galacian Confederation in particular, while sounding very sci-fi, seems to have a lot of potential...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T11:03:22-08:00","id":313854,"title":"","content":"What about North and South America?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T18:30:08-08:00","id":314085,"title":"","content":"North America I think has a Scathatch NPC up there, but I can't think of much more. South America's Dreaming is screwed up thanks to Clan Tremere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T05:43:24-08:00","id":314408,"title":"","content":"Oh, duh! Canada is Kingdom of Northern Ice (Fiona, Shadow Court subplot). Technically you could count Mexico as Kingdom of the Feathered Serpent (Gwydion troll, has to deal w/ nunnehi), but I understand the rest is still being buggered up by one old Tremie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T09:01:29-08:00","id":314584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sarah RPs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/313667-the-dream-kingdoms-of-the-world?p=314085#post314085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">North America I think has a Scathatch NPC up there, but I can't think of much more. South America's Dreaming is screwed up thanks to Clan Tremere.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> What did the Tremere do ? (And in which book can I read about it?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T05:32:32-08:00","id":315292,"title":"","content":"Huh. Ok, I need to apologize. It seems that there are no named canon kingdoms of South America. However, they did say that there was something bad down there. I asked my larp what they wanted to do about that, and it looks like they gave me an answer from a homebrew book from Argentina that's used for some larps there. I misunderstood and thought they were giving me something from VtM I hadn't heard of. It's called &quot;The Court of Neverending Summer&quot; and the dude is Xavier de Cincao, I take it he's canon and in the clanbook was in charge of South America (rumored to have fae contacts) .<br /> <br /> -.-;;; God<br /> <br /> Anyways, I also understand there's some well respected work on Brazilian kiths floating around that was part of the Atlas project. However I haven't been able to find out much more than that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","user":"Sarah RPs","date":". 11-18-2014, 08:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T10:11:41-07:00","id":568111,"title":"","content":"So here's what I've collected together so far: <a href=\"http://w11.zetaboards.com/LivingWoD/topic/10895371/1/?x=0#post8181800\" target=\"_blank\">http://w11.zetaboards.com/LivingWoD/...=0#post8181800</a> I'm also reaching out to some Changeling LARPers in Spain and Northern Europe, but obviously I'm missing Africa and the Near East.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T15:46:41-07:00","id":568455,"title":"","content":"Some time ago I made some maps with all the canon kingdoms and borders. Perhaps they'll be usefull for you.<br /> <br /> I only drew those frontiers I was totally sure about., that's the reason why some kindoms don't have any frontier:<br /> <br /> World Map: <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/9he763g1jecq2jl/mapamundi-ingles.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/view/9he763...ndi-ingles.jpg</a><br /> Europe: <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/c78d34v7s65bp42/europa-ingles.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/view/c78d34...opa-ingles.jpg</a><br /> Ireland / Hibernia: <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/b5c95oazrjzdij1/hibernia-ingles.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/view/b5c95o...nia-ingles.jpg</a><br /> Great Britain / Isle of the Mighty (Official Map): <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/mc321v5kiviigbm/isladelospoderosos-ingles.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/view/mc321v...sos-ingles.jpg</a><br /> Land of 8 Million Dreams: <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/ewkek1z31h7ehne/tierradelos8millonesdesuenos-ingles.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/view/ewkek1...nos-ingles.jpg</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/n6g3njp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/kpa5GS5Mp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/93820aaad7.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/584-eliseo-ap-liam","name":"Eliseo ap Liam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar584_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T08:21:36-07:00","id":569226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/313667-the-dream-kingdoms-of-the-world?p=313854#post313854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about North and South America?</div> </div> </div> </div>North America North of the Rio Grande is Concordia. Mexico and Central America are the Kingdom of the Feathered Serpent. The Caribbean is called the Fifes of Bright Promise. Latin America was left undefined and got slapped down because of the collapse of Arthaus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}